Package: rairai
Title: 'R' Package Intelligence MCP Server
Version: 0.2.6
Authors@R:
    person("Juha", "Itkonen", , "juha@tosidata.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helps artificial intelligence (AI) agents develop 'R' packages
    more efficiently and make better-informed code changes. Provides focused,
    package-aware context through the Model Context Protocol (MCP) so agents
    can understand existing behavior and assess changes with less manual
    exploration. Inspects packages without loading or executing their code.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tosidata/rairai,
    https://tosidata.github.io/rairai/
BugReports: https://github.com/tosidata/rairai/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
